# Rolling release

This project does **not** use semver releases.

- Keep `[workspace.package] version = "0.0.0"` — do not bump
- No `CHANGELOG.md`, no GitHub Releases, no `vX.Y.Z` tags
- Running build identity: `BUILD_NUM` + `GIT_SHA` (dashboard sidebar, startup log, Docker tags `:b<N>`)
- `git log` on `main` is the release history

When changing Docker/CI build args, preserve `GIT_SHA` / build-number injection (see Justfile `build` recipe).
